              "type": "sub_title",
              "value": "🟡 Rewards Structure "
            },
            {
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "frontTextStyle": "default",
              "type": "text",
              "value": "lv.1 - if 6,000 beans recevied, get 1800 beans reward\n\nlv.2 - if 12,000 beans received, get extra 2000 beans reward\n\nlv.3 - if 20,000 beans received, get extra 2,700 beans reward\n\nlv.4 - if 30,000 beans received, get extra 3,500 beans reward\n\nlv.5 - if 40,000 beans received, get extra 4,000 beans reward\n\nlv.6 - if 60,000 beans received, get extra 7,000 beans reward\n\nlv.7 - if 90,000 beans received, get extra 11,000 beans reward\n\nlv.8 - if 120,000 beans received, get extra 11,500 beans reward\n\nThe maximum reward you can receive is 43,500 beans\nHigh up to 36% rebate and higher max beans reward!"
            },
            {
              "frontAlignStyle": "left",
              "frontTextStyle": "default",
              "type": "sub_title",
              "value": "💃 Go live in Solo or Multiguest Room as a host at least 20 mins within the hour, and you can do all event formats you like!"
